    "hangar_ramp": "zone_the_reach_870_1958",
    "intro_lore": "Welcome to the Reach: a smear of light in a hundred miles of scrub, a long haul off every road the Architect ever paved. Most come in by air, and Buzzard Field is the easy door; the overland way is a gauntlet of dust and dead ground that eats anyone who tries it soft. They'll take your fuel money and your silence and, if you're the right kind of wrong, they'll let you stay. The Reach doesn't trust outsiders; it survives on the ones it lets in. Whatever you're running, nobody here will ask to see it.",
